      "type": "grammar",
      "title": "怎么 + verb: asking how",
      "body": "To ask how someone does something, put 怎么 right before the verb. 怎么去 means 'how do (you) get there'. To answer, simply replace 怎么 with the way you do it, like 坐火车 or 开车.",
